.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, r2SCAN-3c with CPCM (water), optimisation and frequencies of Na+(H2O)6, started from the gas-phase geometry and Hessian of the step before. This calculation shows the arrangement with five waters in the first shell and one in the second in water, where the order of the arrangements differs from the gas phase.
